    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17744" root="زعب" body-key="z">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزعّب</span></b>  <i>He was brisk, lively,</i> or <i>sprightly;</i>
(K, TA;) and <i>quick.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, angered,</i> or <i>enraged.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزعّب فِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْلِهِ وَشُرْبِهِ</span> <i>He was immoderate in his eating
and his drinking; he ate and drank much.</i> (K.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزعّب القَوْمُ المَالَ</span> <i>The people,</i> or <i>party, divided
among themselves the property,</i> or <i>wealth;</i> (K;)
<i>divided it into parts,</i> or <i>portions.</i> (TA.)

